On an earnings call in late April, Apple's CEO Tim Cook said that customer response to the MacBook Neo was "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/05/01/apple-was-caught-off-guard-by-macbook-neo/">off the charts</a>," and the popularity of the laptop has reportedly led the company to significantly boost production.<br/>
<br/>
